# Exception: pythonapi/models is a source package (Pydantic schemas + ORM),
# not an ML weights directory. The broad `**/models` rule above would
# otherwise drop it from the Docker build context.
!apps/pythonapi/pythonapi/models
!apps/pythonapi/pythonapi/models/**


